# From "Educational Opportunities" (Wave VIII - Union, CD2-3).

@segment  educational-center
@title    The Educational Center
@levels   F27
@duration ~3m30s

say Move your intention to the Educational Center of Focus 27 -- a place of teaching, instruction, training, and learning.
pause 6
say Observe what's around you. Notice the activities taking place. Let whatever impressions come, come.
pause 8
say Ask for a personal demonstration -- a personal experience of how learning happens here. Maybe a simulation, something to watch and apply. Maybe a specific skill, guided step by step. Maybe a lecture hall, a class, a reading room, a hall of records. Maybe a tutor, or a counselor, sitting with you directly.
pause 12
say However it comes, stay open to it. Ask for your own personal experience here.
hold 60
say Give thanks for what you've received. Make the intention to remember it.
pause 6
